Added ``Calendar.merge_equivalent_timezones()`` to merge embedded VTIMEZONE components that carry different TZIDs but define equivalent transition rules. All TZID references (including ``X-WR-TIMEZONE``) are rewritten to the surviving TZID, redundant definitions are removed, and date-times keep their UTC semantics at historical offsets and around daylight saving fold and jump boundaries. The surviving TZID is chosen deterministically and the method is idempotent.
